              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
                <td style="padding: 15px; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid var(--border);"><strong>Base Polymer</strong></td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">EVA (High/Low VA), APAO, Metallocene Polyolefins</td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Forms the continuous phase. Establishes the solid mechanical cohesion, tensile load capacity, and ultimate shear resistance.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
                <td style="padding: 15px; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid var(--border);"><strong>Tackifier Resins</strong></td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Rosin Esters, Terpene Phenolics, C5/C9 Hydrocarbons</td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Reduces elastic modulus (G') in melt, lowers bulk surface tension, and enables rapid surface wetting and polar adhesion.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
                <td style="padding: 15px; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid var(--border);"><strong>Crystalline Waxes</strong></td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Paraffin, Microcrystalline, Fischer-Tropsch Waxes</td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Drastically reduces molten bulk viscosity for pump extrusion. Rapidly crystallizes upon cooling to control set speed.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
                <td style="padding: 15px; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid var(--border);"><strong>Antioxidants</strong></td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Hindered Phenols (Primary), Phosphites (Secondary)</td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Scavenges free radicals and decomposes hydroperoxides to prevent thermal degradation, skinning, and charring.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);">
                <td style="padding: 15px; font-weight: 600; border: 1px solid var(--border);"><strong>Functional Fillers</strong></td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Precipitated Calcium Carbonate, Talc, Barium Sulfate</td>
                <td style="padding: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--border);">Increases bulk density, alters molten heat capacity, limits shrinkage during solidification, and reduces compound cost.</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
